t likely?",["Rising sea levels","Increased glacier formation","Reduced temperatures","Less evaporation"],"A",5,1,"9d7640296fb5"],["Which environmental problem results from the accumulation of greenhouse gases over long periods?",["Global warming","Water pollution only","Neutralization","Filtration"],"A",5,1,"e7de1c7b1b0d"],["A scientist recommends reducing fossil fuel consumption, planting more trees, and using renewable energy. These measures are primarily intended to combat:",["Global warming","Water hardness","Distillation losses","Crystallization problems"],"A",5,1,"ab04e691f754"],["Clean, dry air is best described as:",["a compound of nitrogen and oxygen","a mixture of gases","pure nitrogen","pure oxygen"],"B",1,0,"b25bab4f9e3c"],["Nitrogen dioxide dissolving in rainwater can produce:",["nitric acid","citric acid","acetic acid","hydrochloric acid"],"A",3,0,"b8cd63eec6a4"],["Farmers burning crop waste and cars burning petrol both add to:",["air pollution and global warming","ozone layer repair","cleaner air","cooler temperatures"],"A",3,1,"84f8714e200d"],["Melting of glaciers is a result of:",["global warming","acid rain only","lower temperatures","more polar ice"],"A",1,0,"a4c2c2914dd9"],["A traffic jam in a busy city releases large amounts of:",["nitrogen oxides and carbon monoxide","pure oxygen","gold dust","water only"],"A",1,1,"9d9adac14fb5"],["The formula of carbon monoxide is:",["CO","CO₂","C₂O","CH₄"],"A",1,0,"52d33034668b"],["Rotting waste in a landfill site releases a greenhouse gas. The gas is:",["methane","oxygen","nitrogen","helium"],"A",3,1,"faa093e163ea"]]$j$::jsonb, true);
